# Tracked: source (scripts, workers/_template, *.ps1) and docs (README, docs/, CONTRACT.md, folder_description.md).
# Not tracked: anything setup.ps1 / manage.py can re-create, and everything specific to one PC: model weights,
# models/registry.json (your models, roles, hardware), per-folder model listings, your own workers.

# Downloaded binaries: re-created by scripts/setup.ps1 (keep only our descriptions)
/bin/**
!/bin/**/
!/bin/**/folder_description.md
/bin/audiocpp/model_specs/
/bin/audiocpp/tools/

# Model weights, the registry and per-folder listings are this PC's state (setup.ps1 creates a fresh registry)
/models/**
!/models/folder_description.md

# Your own Python workers (keep the template)
/workers/*/
!/workers/_template/

# Generated per machine by manage.py (absolute paths, this PC's pools)
/config/llama-swap.yaml
/config/audiocpp/*.json

# Caches, tools, downloads, leftovers
/.uv-cache/
/tools/
/_downloads/
/_trash/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.part
